OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fpersistent rain tonight, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes into the early hours of Friday.
OL,8,FBecoming much milder than last night
OL,9,Fwith winds turning westerly in
OL,10,Fdirection. These winds strengthening
OL,11,Finto the early hours of Friday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FRain, occasionally heavy, will
OL,14,Fclear into the afternoon to become
OL,15,Fbright with a few scattered showers
OL,16,Fand a blustery westerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
